OL,3,GNEWSA'Two years without Sunday trains
OL,4,Ais appalling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have staged a protest at a
OL,7,Frailway station to mark two years since
OL,8,Fthe last Sunday train stopped in their
OL,9,Ftown.
OL,11,FThe group gathered in Congleton,
OL,12,FCheshire, as they continued to call for
OL,13,FNorthern to solve a long-running
OL,14,Fdispute with workers that has left the
OL,15,Ftown without Sunday trains.
OL,17,FSince then, rail-replacement buses have
OL,18,Fbeen operating instead, but members of
OL,19,Fcommunity group Congleton Train Users,
OL,20,Fresidents and councillors claimed they
OL,21,Fwere unreliable.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
